    "title": "Cracked Column Forces Clark County Jail to Ship 45 Inmates to Logan County - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Amelia Simmons ,\n8 hours ago\nA cracked exterior support column at the Clark County Jail has forced officials to move 45 inmates to a neighboring county's lockup while crews scramble to shore up the aging structure. Clark County commissioners approved an emergency contract with Bruns Construction on Wednesday to temporarily brace the damaged column, a stopgap measure expected to cost taxpayers while the jail sorts out a permanent fix.\nRead full article",
